tent/dam/ccg-gcc/images/features-vedettes/academy-academie60.png\" alt=\"\" />\n<h3><a href=\"/en/canadian-coast-guard/services/academy/look-inside.html\" class=\"stretched-link\">A look inside the Canadian Coast Guard Academy</a></h3>\n<p>The Canadian Coast Guard Academy is celebrating a proud legacy of 60 years of marine training excellence.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
